#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186294524 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "864cf210-cbb0-5a79-b90a-33a5df332559" :knowledge-point/title "Computing the Eigenvalues of a Matrix With Two Distinct Eigenvalues"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "958eb313-8eb6-5031-a652-a4e5dd9925fd" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-4$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294526} {:answer/id #uuid "9a2c98c8-dde6-5160-860d-95f972eed39f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =2$  (double root)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294527} {:answer/id #uuid "86c421c8-23b5-5b82-9614-79651e5ebf72" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =-2$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294528} {:answer/id #uuid "1199a2e1-6452-5f3c-adbc-e5506a0a9b81" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "There are no real eigenvalues" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294529} {:answer/id #uuid "b625c85e-ad5b-5b27-99e8-54f4d0d6d292" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =2$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294530}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b625c85e-ad5b-5b27-99e8-54f4d0d6d292" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "$\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =2$" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294530} :answer-field/id #uuid "d1d8f83f-93a5-5a9a-bb8f-efe63bf1e4f9" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186294525}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045463 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d2a59a38-6b0a-5bff-ab4c-adc26ea6a0e6" :question/math-academy-id "q-12296" :question/problem "Find all real eigenvalues of the matrix\n$S=[\\begin{aligned}-8 & 4 \\\\ -5 & 4\\end{aligned}].$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by writing the matrix $S-\\lambda I:$\n﻿﻿﻿\n\n$$\nS-\\lambda I=[\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 4 \\\\ -5 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNow, let's find and solve the characteristic equation $det(S-\\lambda I)=0:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(S-\\lambda I) & =0 \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}-8-\\lambda  & 4 \\\\ -5 & 4-\\lambda \\end{aligned}| & =0 \\\\ (-8-\\lambda )(4-\\lambda )-4\\cdot (-5) & =0 \\\\ -32+8\\lambda -4\\lambda +{\\lambda }^{2}+20 & =0 \\\\ {\\lambda }^{2}+4\\lambda -12 & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nUsing the quadratic formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\lambda  & =\\frac{-4\\pm \\sqrt{{4}^{2}+4\\cdot 1\\cdot 12}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4\\pm \\sqrt{64}}{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{-4\\pm 8}{2} \\\\  & =-6,2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the eigenvalues are $\\lambda =-6$ and $\\lambda =2.$"}]}
